sequenceDiagram
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant LSAS as LSAS Agent
    participant Pulse as Pulse Agent
    participant Parso as Parso Agent
    participant Gemini as Gemini Agent
    participant R as Results Store
    
    Note over GH,R: Phase 1: Initialization
    GH->>O: Trigger workflow
    O->>O: Initialize logging
    O->>O: Load configuration
    
    Note over GH,R: Phase 2: Parallel Execution
    par Execute Agents in Parallel
        O->>LSAS: Start analysis
        LSAS->>LSAS: Detect languages
        LSAS->>LSAS: Run static analysis
        LSAS->>R: Save LSAS report
    and
        O->>Pulse: Start monitoring
        Pulse->>Pulse: Collect metrics
        Pulse->>Pulse: Analyze performance
        Pulse->>R: Save Pulse report
    and
        O->>Parso: Start parsing
        Parso->>Parso: Discover files
        Parso->>Parso: Parse syntax
        Parso->>R: Save Parso report
    and
        O->>Gemini: Start AI analysis
        Gemini->>Gemini: Analyze repository
        Gemini->>Gemini: Generate insights
        Gemini->>R: Save Gemini report
    end
    
    Note over GH,R: Phase 3: Aggregation & Reporting
    R->>O: Return all results
    O->>O: Generate summary report
    O->>GH: Upload artifacts
    GH->>GH: Update status tracking
    
    Note over GH,R: Optional: Deployment
    alt If main branch
        GH->>GH: Deploy to Cloud Run
        GH->>GH: Deploy to Vercel
    end
